// What scrap becomes, and the only thing that consumes it.
//
// Scrap has been harvestable since M3 and until now dead-ended at the
// enclave's trade board — a fine thing for a material to also do and a
// poor thing for it to only do. That is why `SYSTEMS.md` §3.11 could
// not answer whether stopping at a ruin is ever genuinely "it depends":
// scrap bought poles and nothing else, so the answer was "yes, if you
// happen to be passing".
//
// Alloy is the input to both things that gate the tower's ceiling — the
// elevator, through mechanisms, and charge capacity, through cells — so
// a ruin is now worth a decision rather than a shrug.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
ItemDef(
    id: "item.alloy",
    name: "Alloy",
    glyph: "🔩",
    order: 26,
)
